WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.999
Begin at Home. Find Edit and Music projects, or switch to Social.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.999
Create a project. Import your media and drag clips onto the timeline.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.999
Move and trim clips. Add text and effects, preview, then export.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.999
In Music studio, arrange audio, inspect waveforms, detect beats and mix.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.999
Ask Vanessa for creative help when AI processing is enabled and online.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.999
Keep editing. Studio media stays local until you choose to share.
